{"candidateAnswer":"six months","evidence":"[D5:1 | 7:52 pm on 7 August, 2023] Evan: Hey Sam, how's it going? Last week I went on a trip to Canada and something unreal happened - I met this awesome Canadian woman and it was like something out of a movie. She's incredible and being with her makes me feel alive.\n[D21:1 | 4:25 pm on 26 December, 2023] Sam: Hey Evan! Long time no see, how's it going?","itemId":"urn:uuid:c5e8271a-9fbb-59f6-b418-80a996528bf5","provenance":{"sourceCommitment":"sha256:c6a12d5145b652b00372281935a1cbd3945a64fba804459ba9e3233f5d9ca72a","timestamp":"2026-04-02T14:22:55Z"},"question":"How long did Evan and his partner date before getting married?","referenceAnswer":"four months","sources":[{"digest":{"sha256":"c6a12d5145b652b00372281935a1cbd3945a64fba804459ba9e3233f5d9ca72a"}}]}